-- WoW Forever: object templates from ten live client caches of 11-17 to 11-23 that our world and the queued kits lack (no
-- spawns yet: the cache has templates only). Among them the Krol'dok door 701671, Guard Tower Portcullis 701656, Meeting Stone
-- 701659, Instance Portal 630546, Portcullis Lever 649337, the Krol'dok camp braziers, bonfires, forges and anvils, Pillar of
-- Amethyst 701691, Seed of the World Tree 625598, herb nodes Grave Moss 657389 / Blindweed 657400. Left out: the five the quest
-- builder kit already adds (580100, 620424, 629451, 667674) or checks (630696). Safe to run again.
